## SQ-RE-31 | pressure chamber: 8 coal blocks per diamond (was 9), 4 per diamond shard
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest makes minecraft:diamond`; `/cdevtest bytype pneumaticcraft:pressure_chamber max=400`
@pass a `pneumaticcraft:pressure_chamber` recipe makes `minecraft:diamond*1` from 8 coal blocks (the ingredient shows `minecraft:coal_block`; the count is in `part=fields` or the JSON); the shard recipe from 4 is unchanged
@fails `crystal.js` `Item.of(i.coal_block, 8)`
> cdevtest makes minecraft:diamond
> cdevtest bytype pneumaticcraft:pressure_chamber max=400
# judge-8 2026-11-21: cdevtest prints result=empty for PneumaticCraft recipes; the NCH id carries the count
expect verb=bytype id=creativeengineering:pcpressurechamber/8_coal_block_to_diamond_by_pressure
expect verb=bytype id=creativeengineering:pcpressurechamber/4_coal_block_to_diamond_shard_by_pressure
look the coal block count of the diamond recipe is 8 (rdetail the id from the makes line; part=fields or the dumped JSON)

## SQ-RE-32 | single cinder flour Create filling: redstone, glowstone dust, gunpowder at 25 mB
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest rdetail cinder_redstone_filling`; `/cdevtest rdetail cinder_glowstone_filling`; `/cdevtest rdetail cinder_gunpowder_filling`
@pass three `create:filling` recipes, each one cinder flour -> 1 `minecraft:redstone` / `minecraft:glowstone_dust` / `minecraft:gunpowder`; the fluid (the potion) 25 mB as the other seven singles
@fails `dust.js` createFilling calls
> cdevtest rdetail cinder_redstone_filling
> cdevtest rdetail cinder_glowstone_filling
> cdevtest rdetail cinder_gunpowder_filling
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*cinder_redstone_filling serializer=create:filling result=minecraft:redstone\*1
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*cinder_glowstone_filling serializer=create:filling result=minecraft:glowstone_dust\*1
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*cinder_gunpowder_filling serializer=create:filling result=minecraft:gunpowder\*1
look each ingredients= starts with the cinder flour; part=fields (if printed) shows 25 mB

## SQ-RE-33 | thunder detector assembly: the filling step takes the regular mundane potion only
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest rdetail thunder_detector`
@pass the sequenced assembly's filling step fluid NBT has `Bottle:"REGULAR"` and `Potion:"minecraft:mundane"`; in game a splash mundane potion fluid does not advance it (RE-33)
@fails `redstone.js` filling NBT
> cdevtest rdetail thunder_detector
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*thunder_detector\S* .*part=step\d+ serializer=create:filling
look the filling step line names the mundane potion fluid; if the NBT is not printed, read the recipe JSON (/dumprecipes) for Bottle:"REGULAR"

## SQ-RE-34 | Create basin and Vintage vibrating recipes over Create's displayed input/output count are loaded
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest rdetail` on each of the 9 recipes Create warns about at load (`more item inputs (N) than supported (9)`): ash to tuff compacting, deepslate bulk heated and superheated, andesite generation heated and superheated, basalt generation heated and superheated, sand vibrating to shells; then a client check that one heated mixing of each kind runs in a basin
@pass every id is listed with its ingredients (16, 32, 10, 11 entries; 6 vibrating outputs); in a basin the recipe runs and gives its output
@fails a recipe not loaded (rdetail n=0); in game the basin never starts: split the recipe into stacks of 9 or fewer inputs
@from plan_bugfix_r1118.md B7 (r1118 F5)
# r1118 B7 (2026-11-18): exact ids (the prefix andesite_generation_ also matches the unheated recipe); summary line verb=rdetail text=TEXT n= shown=
> cdevtest rdetail creativeengineering:createcompacting/16_ash_to_1_tuff_by_compacting
> cdevtest rdetail creativeengineering:createcompacting/deepslate_bulk_heated
> cdevtest rdetail creativeengineering:createcompacting/deepslate_bulk_superheated
> cdevtest rdetail creativeengineering:createmixing/andesite_generation_heated
> cdevtest rdetail creativeengineering:createmixing/andesite_generation_superheated
> cdevtest rdetail creativeengineering:createmixing/basalt_generation_heated
> cdevtest rdetail creativeengineering:createmixing/basalt_generation_superheated
> cdevtest rdetail creativeengineering:vivibrating/sand_vibrating_to_shells
expect verb=rdetail text=creativeengineering:createcompacting/16_ash_to_1_tuff_by_compacting n=1
expect verb=rdetail text=creativeengineering:createcompacting/deepslate_bulk_heated n=1
expect verb=rdetail text=creativeengineering:createcompacting/deepslate_bulk_superheated n=1
expect verb=rdetail text=creativeengineering:createmixing/andesite_generation_heated n=1
expect verb=rdetail text=creativeengineering:createmixing/andesite_generation_superheated n=1
expect verb=rdetail text=creativeengineering:createmixing/basalt_generation_heated n=1
expect verb=rdetail text=creativeengineering:createmixing/basalt_generation_superheated n=1
expect verb=rdetail text=creativeengineering:vivibrating/sand_vibrating_to_shells n=1
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
look the ingredient lists (16, 32, 10, 11 entries; 6 vibrating outputs); the basin run is a client hand check (one per kind)

