## SQ-RE-40 | wooden cauldron: recipe; every wooden and iron bucket of water, milk, goat milk, nut milk, honey pours in and scoops out; sap, lava and a second fluid refused
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest makes creativedelight:wooden_cauldron`; a wooden cauldron; `/cdevtest use` with each filled bucket (wooden water, milk, goat milk, nut milk, honey; iron water, milk, Hearth and Harvest goat milk, Create honey), `/cdevtest tank`, then `/cdevtest use` with the matching empty bucket; sap and lava bucket on an empty one; milk onto a water-filled one
@pass a shaped recipe makes the cauldron; each pour gives `level=3` and the empty bucket in hand, the tank 1000 mB of that fluid; each scoop gives the filled bucket of that fluid and `level=0`; sap, lava and milk-on-water leave the bucket in hand and the level unchanged
@fails `WoodenCauldronBlock.use` / `WoodenCauldronBlockEntity` (fluid list R10: water, cow, goat, nut milk, Create honey); a fluid id absent from the pack (`fluid_dict.js`); recipe in CD `creativedelight/recipes.js`
@absent creativedelight:wooden_cauldron creativedelight:wooden_goat_milk_bucket creativedelight:wooden_nut_milk_bucket (registered by the Creative Delight jar of 2026-11-21, after the last /dumpall)
> forceload add 5200 5200 5215 5215
> fill 5200 -61 5200 5215 -61 5215 minecraft:stone
> fill 5200 -60 5200 5215 -56 5215 minecraft:air
sleep 2
> cdevtest makes creativedelight:wooden_cauldron
expect verb=makes id=\S+ result=creativedelight:wooden_cauldron\*1
> setblock 5201 -60 5201 creativedelight:wooden_cauldron
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket face=up
> cdevtest tank 5201 -60 5201
expect verb=tank tanks=1 fluids=0:minecraft:water\*1000/1000
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_bucket face=up
expect verb=use main=creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?creativedelight:wooden_cauldron\[level=0\]
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_milk_bucket face=up
> cdevtest tank 5201 -60 5201
expect verb=tank tanks=1 fluids=0:minecraft:milk\*1000/1000
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_bucket face=up
expect verb=use main=creativedelight:wooden_milk_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?creativedelight:wooden_cauldron\[level=0\]
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_goat_milk_bucket face=up
> cdevtest tank 5201 -60 5201
expect verb=tank tanks=1 fluids=0:hearthandharvest:goat_milk\*1000/1000
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_bucket face=up
expect verb=use main=creativedelight:wooden_goat_milk_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?creativedelight:wooden_cauldron\[level=0\]
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_nut_milk_bucket face=up
> cdevtest tank 5201 -60 5201
expect verb=tank tanks=1 fluids=0:creativedelight:nut_milk\*1000/1000
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_bucket face=up
expect verb=use main=creativedelight:wooden_nut_milk_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?creativedelight:wooden_cauldron\[level=0\]
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_honey_bucket face=up
> cdevtest tank 5201 -60 5201
expect verb=tank tanks=1 fluids=0:create:honey\*1000/1000
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_bucket face=up
expect verb=use main=creativedelight:wooden_honey_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?creativedelight:wooden_cauldron\[level=0\]
count verb=use main=creativedelight:wooden_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?creativedelight:wooden_cauldron\[level=3\] >= 5
# iron buckets (any bucket item with a fluid handler)
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=minecraft:water_bucket face=up
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=minecraft:bucket face=up
expect verb=use main=minecraft:water_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?creativedelight:wooden_cauldron\[level=0\]
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=minecraft:milk_bucket face=up
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=minecraft:bucket face=up
expect verb=use main=minecraft:milk_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?creativedelight:wooden_cauldron\[level=0\]
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=hearthandharvest:goat_milk_bucket face=up
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=minecraft:bucket face=up
expect verb=use main=hearthandharvest:goat_milk_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?creativedelight:wooden_cauldron\[level=0\]
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=create:honey_bucket face=up
> cdevtest use 5201 -60 5201 held=minecraft:bucket face=up
expect verb=use main=create:honey_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?creativedelight:wooden_cauldron\[level=0\]
