## SQ-RE-41 | wooden cauldron: rain adds water, comparator reads the level, drops itself with an axe
@group A
@commands a whole chunk (x 5216 to 5231, z 5200 to 5215) of wooden cauldrons under the open sky, a bot nearby (chunks tick only near a player), `/weather rain`, `/cdevtest tickwarp 6400`, `/cdevtest ages` on the level; a comparator reading a cauldron filled then emptied by bucket; `/cdevtest loot` with an iron axe
@pass rain: mean level above 0 (about 20 levels over the 256 at vanilla's 5 % per precipitation tick, `hist` shows only 0 and 1 mostly); comparator `OutputSignal:3` when full, `0` after the scoop; loot one wooden cauldron
@fails `WoodenCauldronBlock.handlePrecipitation` (D9; water only, empty or water cauldron); `getAnalogOutputSignal`; loot table `creativedelight:blocks/wooden_cauldron`; a mean of 0 with the bot present = the chunk did not tick (check `/cdevtest chunk 5224 5208`)
@absent creativedelight:wooden_cauldron (registered by the Creative Delight jar of 2026-11-21, after the last /dumpall)
> forceload add 5200 5192 5231 5215
> fill 5216 -61 5200 5231 -61 5215 minecraft:stone
> fill 5216 -60 5200 5231 -50 5215 minecraft:air
> fill 5216 -60 5200 5231 -60 5215 creativedelight:wooden_cauldron
> pbot spawn re41 5224.5 -60 5196.5 minecraft:overworld survival
> gamerule doWeatherCycle false
> weather rain 1000000
sleep 3
> cdevtest tickwarp 6400
waitlog verb=tickwarp .*end=done 600
> cdevtest ages 5216 -60 5200 5231 -60 5215 creativedelight:wooden_cauldron prop=level
expect verb=ages .*n=256\b
expect verb=ages .*mean=(?!0(\.0+)?\b)\d
> weather clear 1000000
> pbot remove re41
# comparator: facing points at its input
> fill 5202 -60 5204 5204 -60 5204 minecraft:air
> setblock 5203 -60 5204 creativedelight:wooden_cauldron
> setblock 5204 -60 5204 minecraft:comparator[facing=west]
> cdevtest use 5203 -60 5204 held=creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket face=up
> cdevtest tickwarp 6
waitlog verb=tickwarp .*end=done 60
> cdevtest be 5204 -60 5204
expect verb=be .*OutputSignal:3\b
> cdevtest use 5203 -60 5204 held=creativedelight:wooden_bucket face=up
> cdevtest tickwarp 6
waitlog verb=tickwarp .*end=done 60
> cdevtest be 5204 -60 5204
expect verb=be .*OutputSignal:0\b
> cdevtest loot 5203 -60 5204 tool=minecraft:iron_axe
expect verb=loot .*drops=creativedelight:wooden_cauldron:1\b
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
look the ages hist line: levels 1 (and maybe 2) only where rain fell, no level from any other fluid

## SQ-RE-42 | wooden buckets on the vanilla cauldron: fill, scoop a full one, a partial and a lava cauldron refused
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest use` on `minecraft:cauldron`, `water_cauldron[level=1]`, `water_cauldron[level=3]` and `lava_cauldron` with the wooden water and the empty wooden bucket
@pass wooden water on empty -> `water_cauldron[level=3]`, empty wooden bucket in hand; empty wooden on that full one -> `minecraft:cauldron`, wooden water bucket; wooden water on a level-1 water cauldron -> level 3; empty wooden on level 1 -> nothing; lava cauldron ignores both
@fails `WoodenBucketBehaviors` cauldron interaction maps (`CauldronInteraction.EMPTY` / `WATER`), registered at common setup
> forceload add 5232 5200 5247 5215
> fill 5232 -61 5200 5247 -61 5215 minecraft:stone
> fill 5232 -60 5200 5247 -56 5215 minecraft:air
sleep 2
> setblock 5233 -60 5201 minecraft:cauldron
> cdevtest use 5233 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket face=up
expect verb=use main=creativedelight:wooden_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?minecraft:water_cauldron\[level=3\]
> cdevtest use 5233 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_bucket face=up
expect verb=use main=creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?minecraft:cauldron"?(\s|$)
> setblock 5235 -60 5201 minecraft:water_cauldron[level=1]
> cdevtest use 5235 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_bucket face=up
expect verb=use main=creativedelight:wooden_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?minecraft:water_cauldron\[level=1\]
> cdevtest use 5235 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket face=up
count verb=use main=creativedelight:wooden_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?minecraft:water_cauldron\[level=3\] >= 2
> setblock 5237 -60 5201 minecraft:lava_cauldron
> cdevtest use 5237 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket face=up
expect verb=use main=creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?minecraft:lava_cauldron
> cdevtest use 5237 -60 5201 held=creativedelight:wooden_bucket face=up
expect verb=use main=creativedelight:wooden_bucket\*1 off=empty state="?minecraft:lava_cauldron
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0

## SQ-RE-43 | dispenser: wooden water bucket places and comes back empty, the empty one scoops, other buckets drop as items
@group A
@commands dispensers facing east with (a) a wooden water bucket, (b) 3 empty wooden buckets and a water source in front, (c) a wooden milk bucket, (d) an empty wooden bucket and air in front; a redstone block above each fires it; (a) is fired a second time at its own water
@pass (a) water in front, slot 0 the empty wooden bucket; second fire: front air, slot 0 the wooden water bucket; (b) 2 empty wooden buckets and 1 wooden water bucket inside, front air; (c) and (d) the bucket lies on the ground as an item, the front block unchanged
@fails `DispenserBlock.registerBehavior` in `WoodenBucketBehaviors` (D4); a stack that cannot fit the filled one drops it (writeup 2.8)
> forceload add 5232 5200 5247 5215
> fill 5240 -61 5204 5246 -61 5214 minecraft:stone
> fill 5240 -60 5204 5246 -56 5214 minecraft:air
sleep 2
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item,x=5243,y=-60,z=5209,distance=..8]
# each water front cell is walled in stone so no flow reaches the other dispensers or the dropped items
> fill 5240 -60 5204 5242 -60 5209 minecraft:stone
> setblock 5241 -60 5205 minecraft:air
> setblock 5241 -60 5208 minecraft:air
> setblock 5240 -60 5205 minecraft:dispenser[facing=east]{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket",Count:1b}]}
> setblock 5240 -59 5205 minecraft:redstone_block
> cdevtest tickwarp 10
waitlog verb=tickwarp .*end=done 60
> cdevtest state 5241 -60 5205
expect verb=state .*state="?minecraft:water\[level=0\]
> cdevtest inv 5240 -60 5205
expect verb=inv slot=0 item=creativedelight:wooden_bucket\*1
> setblock 5240 -59 5205 minecraft:air
> cdevtest tickwarp 4
waitlog verb=tickwarp .*end=done 60
> setblock 5240 -59 5205 minecraft:redstone_block
> cdevtest tickwarp 10
waitlog verb=tickwarp .*end=done 60
> cdevtest state 5241 -60 5205
expect verb=state .*state="?minecraft:air
> cdevtest inv 5240 -60 5205
expect verb=inv slot=0 item=creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket\*1
# (b) a stack of empties: the filled one goes to a free slot
> setblock 5240 -60 5208 minecraft:dispenser[facing=east]{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"creativedelight:wooden_bucket",Count:3b}]}
> setblock 5241 -60 5208 minecraft:water
> setblock 5240 -59 5208 minecraft:redstone_block
> cdevtest tickwarp 10
waitlog verb=tickwarp .*end=done 60
> cdevtest inv 5240 -60 5208
expect verb=inv slot=0 item=creativedelight:wooden_bucket\*2
count verb=inv slot=\d+ item=creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket\*1 >= 2
# (c) milk and (d) empty with nothing to scoop: dropped as items
> setblock 5240 -60 5211 minecraft:dispenser[facing=east]{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"creativedelight:wooden_milk_bucket",Count:1b}]}
> setblock 5240 -59 5211 minecraft:redstone_block
> setblock 5240 -60 5214 minecraft:dispenser[facing=east]{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"creativedelight:wooden_bucket",Count:1b}]}
> setblock 5240 -59 5214 minecraft:redstone_block
> cdevtest tickwarp 10
waitlog verb=tickwarp .*end=done 60
> cdevtest items 5242 -60 5211 2 keep
expect verb=items .*creativedelight:wooden_milk_bucket:1\b
> cdevtest items 5242 -60 5214 2 keep
expect verb=items .*creativedelight:wooden_bucket:1\b
> cdevtest state 5241 -60 5211
reject verb=state .*state="?minecraft:milk
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0

## SQ-RE-44 | goat and cow milking into the wooden bucket; drinking wooden goat and nut milk clears effects and returns the bucket
@group A
@commands bot `re44` with an empty wooden bucket interacts with a NoAI goat, then a cow; `/effect give re44 minecraft:speed 120`, hold the wooden goat milk bucket, `pbot useitem re44 main 40`, `/cdevtest player re44`; again with the wooden nut milk bucket
@pass goat -> `creativedelight:wooden_goat_milk_bucket`, cow -> `creativedelight:wooden_milk_bucket`; after each drink no Speed effect and the main hand holds `creativedelight:wooden_bucket*1`
@fails `WoodenBucketMilking` (goat branch, Hearth and Harvest goat milk fluid); the drink use in `WoodenBucketItem` (milk ids R11)
@absent creativedelight:wooden_goat_milk_bucket creativedelight:wooden_nut_milk_bucket (registered by the Creative Delight jar of 2026-11-21, after the last /dumpall)
> forceload add 5248 5200 5263 5215
> fill 5248 -61 5200 5263 -61 5215 minecraft:stone
> fill 5248 -60 5200 5263 -56 5215 minecraft:air
sleep 2
> pbot spawn re44 5250.5 -60 5202.5 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 2
> summon minecraft:goat 5252 -60 5202 {NoAI:1b,Age:0,Tags:["re44g"]}
> summon minecraft:cow 5252 -60 5205 {NoAI:1b,Age:0,Tags:["re44c"]}
sleep 1
> pbot hold re44 creativedelight:wooden_bucket 1
> pbot interact re44 @e[tag=re44g,limit=1]
expect verb=pbot\.interact bot=re44 .*result=(CONSUME|SUCCESS) held_after=creativedelight:wooden_goat_milk_bucket\*1\b
> pbot hold re44 creativedelight:wooden_bucket 1
> pbot interact re44 @e[tag=re44c,limit=1]
expect verb=pbot\.interact bot=re44 .*result=(CONSUME|SUCCESS) held_after=creativedelight:wooden_milk_bucket\*1\b
> effect give re44 minecraft:speed 120
> pbot hold re44 creativedelight:wooden_goat_milk_bucket 1
> pbot useitem re44 main 40
waitlog verb=pbot.useitem bot=re44 end=finish item=creativedelight:wooden_goat_milk_bucket 30
> cdevtest player re44
> effect give re44 minecraft:speed 120
> pbot hold re44 creativedelight:wooden_nut_milk_bucket 1
> pbot useitem re44 main 40
waitlog verb=pbot.useitem bot=re44 end=finish item=creativedelight:wooden_nut_milk_bucket 30
> cdevtest player re44
count verb=player name=re44 .*main=creativedelight:wooden_bucket\*1 >= 2
reject verb=player name=re44 .*effects=\S*minecraft:speed
> kill @e[tag=re44g]
> kill @e[tag=re44c]
> pbot remove re44
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0

