## CQ-RE-01 | look: wooden cauldron in world with each fluid, the filled wooden buckets in hand and inventory
@group client
@commands platform at 0 100 0; five wooden cauldrons filled with water, milk, goat milk, nut milk, honey (bucket clicks) and one empty; hotbar with the wooden bucket and its six filled buckets; shots of the cauldrons and the hotbar
@pass LOOK: the cauldron shows spruce wood (painted onto the vanilla cauldron shape), the feet gap as vanilla's; each fluid's surface at full height with its own color (water biome-tinted); each bucket shows its own fill (milk from vanilla's milk bucket, sap from Hearth and Harvest's, honey from Create's, goat milk from Hearth and Harvest's goat milk bucket, nut milk the bottle's color), none the water bucket; no missing-texture log line
@fails CD `assets/creativedelight/textures/block/wooden_cauldron_*`, `textures/item/wooden_*_bucket`; the block entity renderer in `farm/bucket/client/` (fluid still sprite and tint)
@reviewed 2026-11-21
@absent creativedelight:wooden_cauldron creativedelight:wooden_goat_milk_bucket creativedelight:wooden_nut_milk_bucket (registered by the Creative Delight jar of 2026-11-21, after the last /dumpall)
