## CQ-RE-02 | hand: Create pipes on the wooden cauldron, milk in machines and grids return the wooden bucket, S&D tag in JEI
@group client
@commands creative world on the instance mods: (1) Create fluid tank of water -> pump -> pipe -> wooden cauldron, then reverse the pump; (2) Cooking Pot recipe taking milk (JEI `@farmersdelight` U on the wooden milk bucket) with a wooden milk bucket; (3) Hostile Delight magical butter in the grid with a wooden milk bucket; (4) Canned Powdered Milk with wooden milk buckets; (5) the Golden Milk Bucket recipe with a wooden milk bucket in the grid; (6) heated mixer: coffee + goat milk, then coffee + nut milk; (7) Kettle on a heat source with goat milk, then nut milk, cocoa beans and sugar; (8) JEI on a Slice & Dice mixing copy of hot cocoa
@pass (1) the pipe fills the cauldron step by step and the reversed pump drains it; (2) to (4) the dish is made and an empty wooden bucket comes back; (5) no output; (6) Milk Coffee both times; (7) Hot Cocoa both times; (8) the milk slot cycles cow, goat and nut milk (the tag)
@fails (1) the fluid-handler capability of `WoodenCauldronBlockEntity`; (2) to (4) the wooden bucket's crafting remainder (`WoodenBucketItem`) or the `milk.js` swaps; (5) golden.js; (6) `drinks.js` milk(); (7) `kettle.js` MILKS; (8) `SliceAndDiceMilkTagMixin`
@draft hand checks across machines and grids: the first runner writes driver steps (or keeps it a hand list) once the server rows SQ-RE-40 to -47 have passed
